<title>MALAYSIA: Federal Flour 1996 net down 21 pct.</title>
<headline>Federal Flour 1996 net down 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 114.76   vs	 145.18</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	 51.43   vs	  65.07</p>
<p>    Turnover		 3,707.12   vs     4,259.63</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   140.26   vs	 168.62</p>
<p>    Minorities	  less   2.77   vs  less   0.59</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    nil    vs  less   2.04</p>
<p>    Dividend  (pct)	   14.0    vs	  12.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Federal Flour Mills Bhd is a flour miller and trader of consumer products.</p>
